{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13752","headline":"八月五日歌 · 顾况","name":"八月五日歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月八日明星出，摩耶夫人降前佛。\n八月五日佳气新，昭成太后生圣人。\n开元九年燕公说，奉诏听置千秋节。\n丹青庙里贮姚宋，花蕚楼中宴岐薛。\n清乐灵香几处闻，鸾歌凤吹动祥云。\n已於武库见灵鸟，仍向晋山逢老君。\n率土普天无不乐，河清海晏穷寥廓。\n梨园第子传法曲，张果先生进仙药。\n玉座凄凉游帝京，悲翁回首望承明。\n云韶九奏杳然远，唯有五陵松柏声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}